<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - June 26.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - June 26.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- Angolan President Jose Eduardo dos Santos returned on Wednesday from a two-week private visit to Italy.</p>
<p>- The governor of Uige province, Serafim Cananito, said armed bands of UNITA and ex combatants from the former Zaire were moving in the interior of the province.</p>
<p>--Luanda newsroom +2442 360-849</p>
